Design: I propose to weight training samples inversely proportional to their skin tone group frequency so that underrepresented tones are upweighted. Specifically, for each CV fold and for final training we compute sample weights = compute_sample_weight('balanced', tones) on the skin tone array, then pass these weights to LightGBM’s fit method. This addresses fairness without changing inference. The rest of the pipeline (EfficientNet-B0 feature extraction, CV, evaluation, final model saving, prediction function) remains unchanged.
